// A thread opened and closed beside the tribe, then over it on a narrow
// window: the panel slides in and out with its list in it, one piece. The
// list is never drawn without the panel (before it starts in, or left
// behind once it has slid out), nor apart from it on the way.
// check: beside slide=thread hold=chat
// check: covering slide=thread
{"width": 1180}
{"select": "{{tribe}}"}
{"wait": 2}
{"reveal": "replies"}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "beside", "for": 2.5}
{"thread": "visible"}
{"wait": 1}
{"close": "thread"}
{"wait": 1}
{"width": 760}
{"wait": 1}
{"probe": "covering", "for": 2.5}
{"thread": "visible"}
{"wait": 1}
{"close": "thread"}
{"wait": 1}
